WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.068 line:78%
BRIEFING.

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:03.069 line:78%
LET'S GO OUT TO SAN FRANCISCO

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.971 line:78%
NOW ON THE PELOSI CASE.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:07.173 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I AM SAN FRANCISCO DISTRICT

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:09.009 line:78%
ATTORNEY BROOK JENKINS.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:11.845 line:78%
AND I WANT TO START BY FIRST

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:12.812 line:78%
SENDING OUR WELL-WISHES TO

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:15.015 line:78%
MR. PELOSI ONCE AGAIN.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:17.550 line:78%
WE ARE TRULY PRAYING FOR A

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:19.953 line:78%
SPEEDY RECOVERY ON HIS PART.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.954 line:78%
I WANT TO ALSO START BY THANKING

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:22.689 line:78%
THE SAN FRANCISCO POLICE

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:24.991 line:78%
DEPARTMENT FOR THEIR IMMEDIATE

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.291 line:78%
AND SWIFT INVESTIGATION OF THIS

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.394 line:78%
CASE.

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:29.129 line:78%
I AM HERE TODAY TO FORMALLY

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:31.197 line:78%
ANNOUNCE CHARGES AGAINST

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:34.501 line:78%
MR. DAVID DEPAPE IN CONNECTION

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:34.901 line:78%
WITH WITH THE VIOLENT ATTACK ON

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.137 line:78%
MR. PELOSI.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:39.539 line:78%
THE CHARGES THAT WE ARE FILING

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:40.974 line:78%
TODAY INCLUDE ATTEMPTED MURDER,

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.977 line:78%
RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:45.712 line:78%
ASSAULT WITH A DEADLY WEAPON,

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:47.447 line:78%
ELDER ABUSE, FALSE IMPRISONMENT

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:53.553 line:78%
OF AN ELDER AS WELL AS THREATS

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:58.758 line:78%
TO A PUBLIC OFFICIAL AND THEIR

00:00:53.653 --> 00:01:00.460 line:78%
FAMILIES THESE CHARGES ARE BASED

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.561 line:78%
ON THE FOLLOWING FACTS.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:05.298 line:78%
AFFIDAVIT FILED TODAY AS WELL AS

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:06.399 line:78%
IN THE MOTION TO DETAIN

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:08.368 line:78%
MR. DEPAPE THAT WE FILE

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:09.903 line:78%
TOMORROW.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:12.472 line:78%
MR. DEPAPE SPECIFICALLY TARGETED

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.640 line:78%
THE PELOSI HOME TO CONFRONT

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:16.276 line:78%
SPEAKER PELOSI.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:18.678 line:78%
HE FORCED HIS WAY INTO THE HOME

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:20.980 line:78%
THROUGH A REAR GLASS DOOR BY

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:23.383 line:78%
BREAKING THAT GLASS.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:25.251 line:78%
THE DEFENDANT MADE HIS WAY

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:26.820 line:78%
UPSTAIRS TO THE SECOND FLOOR OF

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:29.556 line:78%
THE HOME.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.923 line:78%
LOCATING MR. PELOSI IN HIS BED

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:31.991 line:78%
SLEEPING.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:33.526 line:78%
HE WOKE HIM UP CONFRONTING HIM

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:36.796 line:78%
ABOUT THE WHEREABOUTS OF SPEAKER

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:39.132 line:78%
PELOSI.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:40.967 line:78%
MR. PELOSI, WHO WAS SLEEPING WAS

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:47.707 line:78%
WEARING A LOOSE FITTING PAJAMA

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:49.409 line:78%
SHIRT AND BOXER SHORTS HE WAS

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.944 line:78%
FORCED TO GET OUT OF BED AND

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:52.412 line:78%
SOMETIME IN THAT ENCOUNTER

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:53.680 line:78%
MR. PELOSI ATTEMPTED TO ACCESS

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.447 line:78%
THE ELEVATOR IN THE HOME WHICH

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.749 line:78%
HAS A PHONE.

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:58.318 line:78%
THE DEFENDANT THEN BLOCKED

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.685 line:78%
MR. PELOSI'S ACCESS TO THAT

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:01.154 line:78%
ELEVATOR.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:03.790 line:78%
IT WAS AT SOME POINT AFTER THAT

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:04.757 line:78%
MR. PELOSI ASKED TO GO TO THE

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:10.497 line:78%
BATHROOM, WHICH IS WHERE HE WAS

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:13.666 line:78%
ABLE TO CALL 911 FROM HIS CELL

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:14.968 line:78%
PHONE THE DEFENDANT REALIZING

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:16.536 line:78%
THAT MR. PELOSI CALLED 911.

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:20.573 line:78%
TOOK MR. PELOSI DOWNSTAIRS NEAR

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:22.342 line:78%
THE FRONT DOOR OF THE RESIDENCE.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:24.410 line:78%
TWO POLICE OFFICERS ARRIVED AT

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:25.979 line:78%
THE FRONT DOOR TWO MINUTES AFTER

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:27.914 line:78%
THAT 911 CALL.

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:30.216 line:78%
WHEN THAT DOOR WAS OPENED, THE

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:31.751 line:78%
DEFENDANT WAS HOLDING HIS

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:33.720 line:78%
HAMMER, WHICH MR. PELOSI

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:35.455 line:78%
APPEARED TO BE ATTEMPTING TO

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.757 line:78%
CONTROL BY HOLDING A PORTION OF

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:39.058 line:78%
THAT HAMMER.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:42.128 line:78%
THE DEFENDANT THEN PULLED THE

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:43.129 line:78%
HAMMER AWAY FROM MR. PELOSI AND

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:51.671 line:78%
VIOLENTLY STRUCK HIM IN THE TOP

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:53.506 line:78%
OF HIS HEAD.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:54.140 line:78%
THE POLICE THEN IMMEDIATELY

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:55.308 line:78%
APPREHENDED THE DEFENDANT.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.142 line:78%
WHAT WE ALSO HAVE LEARNED IS

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:59.345 line:78%
THAT THE DEFENDANT BROUGHT TO

00:02:56.276 --> 00:03:00.880 line:78%
THE LOCATION OF THE PELOSI

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:02.715 line:78%
RESIDENCE A SECOND HAMMER AS

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:05.151 line:78%
WELL AS ZIP TIES, ROPE, AND A

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:07.086 line:78%
ROLL OF TAPE.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:08.354 line:78%
WHAT IS CLEAR BASED ON THE

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:09.522 line:78%
EVIDENCE THAT WE HAVE THUS FAR

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:14.327 line:78%
IS THAT THIS HOUSE AND THE

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:15.328 line:78%
SPEAKER HERSELF WERE

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:15.995 line:78%
SPECIFICALLY TARGETS OF THE

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:17.630 line:78%
DEFENDANT.

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:20.266 line:78%
AS FOR NEXT STEPS, THE DEFENDANT

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:21.134 line:78%
IS EXPECTED TO BE ARRAIGNED

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.669 line:78%
TOMORROW AFTERNOON.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:25.505 line:78%
MY OFFICE WILL BE FILING A

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:28.575 line:78%
MOTION TO DETAIN HIM WITHOUT

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:30.677 line:78%
BAIL AMEND THAT IS BASED ON WHAT

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:33.179 line:78%
IS OBVIOUS AND SEVERE PUBLIC

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:34.514 line:78%
SAFETY RISK THAT THE DEFENDANT

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:38.117 line:78%
POSES TO SAN FRANCISCO AS WELL

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:41.087 line:78%
AS THE OUTER COMMUNITY.

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:41.387 line:78%
VIOLENCE HAS NO PLACE IN THIS

00:03:41.187 --> 00:03:43.623 line:78%
CITY.

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:49.395 line:78%
WE WILL WORK VIGOROUSLY TO HOLD

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:51.264 line:78%
THE DEFENDANT ACCOUNTABLE.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:54.801 line:78%
ONE LAST THING THAT I WANT TO

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:57.403 line:78%
SAY TODAY IS THAT AS LEADERS AND

00:03:56.002 --> 00:03:59.072 line:78%
AS CITIZENS IT IS INCUMBENT UPON

00:03:57.503 --> 00:04:01.241 line:78%
US ALL TO WATCH THE WORDS THAT

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:03.977 line:78%
WE SAY AND TO TURN DOWN THE

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:04.344 line:78%
VOLUME OF OUR POLITICAL

00:04:04.077 --> 00:04:08.815 line:78%
RHETORIC.

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:13.853 line:78%
WE SHOULD BE ABLE TO ALL ENGAGE

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:16.589 line:78%
IN PASSIONATE POLITICAL

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:17.890 line:78%
DISCOURSE BUY STILL REMAIN

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:18.057 line:78%
RESPECTFUL OF ONE ANOTHER.

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:18.057 line:78%
VIOLEN

